# Review routing.
#
# The last matching pattern wins, so order matters: the catch-all goes first and
# the sensitive paths go last. Getting that backwards is the classic mistake —
# it silently makes every specific rule below it dead.

*                       @BrosG

# Anything that changes what the project claims about itself.
/README.md              @BrosG
/docs/                  @BrosG

# Security and licence changes should never be a drive-by.
/SECURITY.md            @BrosG
/LICENSE                @BrosG

# CI runs with repository credentials. A workflow change is a privilege change.
/.github/workflows/     @BrosG
